WEBVTT

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.240
that's going to get us to 75.2,

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.120
which is obviously
a long way short of our target.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:12.280
Indeed, on current trends,
we won't hit the 2030 targets until 2094.

00:06:14.360 --> 00:06:15.736
Now, I don't know about you,

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:18.136
but I certainly don't
want to wait that long.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.560
So what can we do about this?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.896
Well, the first thing to do is
we've got to call out the rich countries.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.736
Here are the countries
closest to the SDGs,

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.456
with the greatest resources,

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:29.760
and they're falling short.